## Visualization Outputs

### 1. Detection Video (`output/cam0_detection_visualization.mp4`)
Real-time visualization of AprilTag detection and pose estimation:
- Green polygons: Detected AprilTag boundaries
- Blue dots: Detected corners (sub-pixel refined)
- Yellow text: Tag IDs
- RGB axes: Estimated calibration grid pose
  - Red = X-axis (right)
  - Green = Y-axis (up)  
  - Blue = Z-axis (toward camera)

### 2. Reprojection Debug Images (`output/reprojection_debug/`)
Frames with highest reprojection errors for diagnostics:
- **Green circles**: Inliers (RANSAC)
- **Red circles**: Outliers (RANSAC rejected)
- **Blue filled dots**: Inlier predictions
- **Magenta filled dots**: Outlier predictions
- **Yellow/Purple lines**: Error vectors (detected ↔ reprojected)
- **Cyan numbers**: Tag IDs
- **Statistics overlay**: Error metrics, inlier/outlier counts
- **Legend**: At bottom of frame
